---
layout: base.njk
title: "CAIS 2026 recap: sold out, 623 attendees, 106 papers and demos"
description: The official recap of ACM CAIS 2026 in San Jose, California. 623 attendees, 106 papers and demos, research from 124 institutions across 14 countries.
permalink: /program/2026/recap/
noindex: true
showOpenGraph: true
ogTitle: "CAIS 2026 recap: sold out, 623 attendees, 106 papers and demos"
ogDescription: Sixty papers converged on one project this year, composing AI systems out of many interacting parts. Most of the work was construction. The work the field named outstanding was the work that made those systems trustworthy.
hideCapacityBanner: true
hideSponsorStrip: true
extraStyles: |
    /* ===== Recap page: authority through restraint ===== */
    /* Modular type scale (~1.2 ratio). Seven steps, no near-duplicates.
       overline 13px · sm 15px · base 16px · md 18px · lead 24px · display 32px · stat 48px */
    :root {
        --fs-overline: 0.8125rem;
        --fs-sm: 0.9375rem;
        --fs-base: 1rem;
        --fs-md: 1.125rem;
        --fs-lead: 1.5rem;
        --fs-display: 2rem;
        --fs-stat: 3rem;
        --rhythm-section: 4.5rem;   /* one vertical beat, used everywhere */
        --rhythm-seam: 3rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        :root {
            --rhythm-section: 3.25rem;
            --rhythm-seam: 2.25rem;
        }
    }
    /* Shared overline voice: every small label on the page speaks identically.
       --davys-gray on white is 6.59:1, on --seasalt 6.31:1 — WCAG AA at 13px. */
    .recap-eyebrow, .recap-section-label, .movement-label, .also-heading {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .recap-hero {
        position: relative;
        padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
        background: linear-gradient(rgba(250, 250, 248, 0.6), rgba(250, 250, 248, 0.6)), url('/assets/images/hero ultralight gradient.png') center/cover no-repeat;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .recap-eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .recap-headline {
        font-weight: 700;
        max-width: 22ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        line-height: 1.12;
        letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .recap-standfirst {
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: var(--fs-lead);
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        max-width: 38em;
    }
    .recap-section {
        padding: var(--rhythm-section) 0;
    }
    .recap-section-label {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    /* Record-band title: the h1's typeface, about a third smaller */
    .recap-band-title {
        font-size: var(--fs-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.015em;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    /* Numbers band: a single dark slab — the page's one moment of full contrast.
       --seasalt numerals on --eerie-black: 14.69:1; --silver labels: 9.0:1. */
    .stat-band {
        background: var(--eerie-black);
        border-radius: 4px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        padding: 1.85rem 1.5rem;
        gap: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 575px) {
        .stat-band { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }
    }
    .stat-band .stat {
        text-align: center;
        border-left: 1px solid rgba(250, 250, 248, 0.16);
    }
    .stat-band .stat:first-child { border-left: none; }
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
        .stat-band .stat { border-left: none; }
    }
    .stat-band .stat .value {
        font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.25rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--seasalt);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .stat-band .stat .label {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--silver);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }
    .stat-caption {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
    /* Walls */
    .recap-wall {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .recap-wall .wall-name {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        white-space: nowrap;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: #fff;
    }
    .wall-breadth {
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        font-style: italic;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    /* Sponsor wall: equal cells so mixed logo aspect ratios sit on one grid */
    .recap-sponsor-wall {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .recap-sponsor-wall .logo-cell {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 64px;
    }
    .recap-sponsor-wall img {
        max-height: 30px;
        max-width: 124px;
        width: auto;
        filter: grayscale(1);
        opacity: 0.75;
    }
    .recap-sponsor-wall img.logo-stacked {
        max-height: 48px;
    }
    /* Track cards: the five paper tracks as discrete cells, not a run-on line */
    .track-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
        .track-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 575px) {
        .track-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    .track-card {
        background: var(--seasalt);
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
    }
    .track-card .track-count {
        font-size: var(--fs-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .track-card .track-name {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    .composition-summary {
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
    }
    /* Testimonials: two voices, side by side, between the program and the institutions wall */
    .testimonial-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .testimonial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .testimonial {
        background: var(--seasalt);
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-top: 3px solid var(--terracotta-deep);
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 1.75rem;
        margin: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .testimonial-quote {
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .testimonial-attrib {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.85rem;
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-top: auto;   /* pin attribution to the bottom so unequal-length cards align */
    }
    .testimonial-avatar {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
    }
    .testimonial-attrib .name {
        display: block;
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    }
    .testimonial-attrib a {
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .testimonial-attrib a:hover {
        color: var(--terracotta-deep);
    }
    /* Seams */
    .recap-seam-section {
        padding: var(--rhythm-seam) 0;
    }
    .recap-seam {
        max-width: 44em;
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
    }
    /* Movements. The accent is a terracotta bar, not terracotta type:
       --terracotta-deep on --seasalt is 4.43:1 — under AA for 13px text. */
    .movement-label {
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .movement-label::before {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 2.25rem;
        height: 3px;
        background: var(--terracotta-deep);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .movement-headline {
        font-weight: 700;
        max-width: 30ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .movement-framing {
        max-width: 44em;
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
    /* Award stamps: two tiers, Outstanding clearly dominant.
       White on --terracotta-deep: 4.63:1, AA at this size/weight. */
    .stamp {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
        border-radius: 3px;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .stamp-outstanding {
        background: var(--terracotta-deep);
        color: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--terracotta-deep);
    }
    .stamp-spotlight {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
    }
    .stamp-note {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        margin-left: 0.5rem;
    }
    /* Featured cards: a firm top rule marks them as the chosen few */
    .featured-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-top: 3px solid var(--eerie-black);
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 1.75rem;
        height: 100%;
    }
    .featured-card h3 {
        font-size: var(--fs-base);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .featured-card h3 a {
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    .featured-card h3 a:hover {
        color: var(--terracotta-deep);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
    .featured-card .byline {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .featured-card .gloss {
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    /* Also-in-this-movement: hairline rows turn link soup into an index */
    .also-heading {
        margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
        padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .also-wall {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 0 2.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
        .also-wall { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 575px) {
        .also-wall { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .also-wall li {
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        line-height: 1.4;
        padding: 0.8rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--platinum);
    }
    .also-wall li a {
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .also-wall li a:hover {
        color: var(--terracotta-deep);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
    .also-wall .inst {
        display: block;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    /* Winners record */
    .winners-group-heading {
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 2.5rem 0 0.5rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .winners-list {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .winners-list li {
        padding: 0.85rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--platinum);
    }
    .winners-list li:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
    }
    .winners-list .w-title,
    .spotlight-list .w-title {
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .winners-list .w-title a,
    .spotlight-list .w-title a {
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    .winners-list .w-title a:hover,
    .spotlight-list .w-title a:hover {
        color: var(--terracotta-deep);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
    .winners-list .w-meta,
    .spotlight-list .w-meta {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
    }
    .winners-list .stamp {
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }
    /* Industry Spotlight Awards: one consolidated, filterable record */
    .spotlight-heading .spotlight-subtitle {
        display: block;                  /* line break under the title */
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);   /* author/affiliation metadata register */
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        text-transform: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }
    .spotlight-filter {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
    }
    .spotlight-filter-btn {
        font-size: var(--fs-overline);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-radius: 3px;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
    }
    .spotlight-filter-btn:hover {
        border-color: var(--eerie-black);
        color: var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .spotlight-filter-btn.is-active {
        background: var(--eerie-black);
        border-color: var(--eerie-black);
        color: #fff;
    }
    .spotlight-list {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 0 2.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .spotlight-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .spotlight-list li {
        padding: 0.85rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--platinum);
    }
    .spotlight-list li[hidden] {
        display: none;
    }
    .spotlight-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: calc(var(--fs-overline) * 0.7);  /* 30% smaller */
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.105rem 0.35rem;
        border-radius: 3px;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
        background: #fff;
    }
    .spotlight-tag--paper { border-color: var(--olive-moss); }
    .spotlight-tag--demo { border-color: var(--terracotta-deep); }
    /* Voices */
    .voice-quote {
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .voice-attrib {
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        color: var(--davys-gray);
    }
    /* Close */
    .recap-close {
        padding: 5rem 0;
        background: var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .recap-close-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2.25rem;
    }
    .recap-close-glyph {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: auto;
        height: 120px;
        color: var(--terracotta-deep);
    }
    .recap-close-text {
        text-align: left;
    }
    .recap-close .line1 {
        font-size: var(--fs-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: #fff;
    }
    .recap-close .line2 {
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .recap-close .line2 a {
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }
    .recap-close .line2 a:hover {
        color: #fff;
    }
    @media (max-width: 575px) {
        .recap-close-inner { gap: 1.25rem; }
        .recap-close-glyph { height: 72px; }
    }
    .anchor {
        scroll-margin-top: 84px;
    }
    /* Full-record band: the seam between the executive summary and the browsable record */
    .recap-fullrecord {
        padding: var(--rhythm-section) 0;
        background: var(--platinum);     /* distinct grey band, separates it from the winners section above */
        border-top: 1px solid var(--silver);
    }
    /* Browse-by-theme nav: three doors into the program */
    .movement-nav {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 1rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .movement-nav { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .movement-nav-card {
        display: block;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        background: var(--seasalt);
        border: 1px solid var(--silver);
        border-radius: 4px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .movement-nav-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--eerie-black);
    }
    .movement-nav-card::before {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 2.25rem;
        height: 3px;
        background: var(--terracotta-deep);
        margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }
    .movement-nav-label {
        display: block;
        font-size: var(--fs-md);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--eerie-black);
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }
    .movement-nav-line {
        display: block;
        font-size: var(--fs-sm);
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: var(--davys-gray);
    }
---

{# ============ 1. Top unit ============ #}
<header id="top" class="recap-hero anchor">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="recap-eyebrow">{{ recap2026.eyebrow }}</p>
        <h1 class="display-5 recap-headline">{{ recap2026.headline }}</h1>
        <p class="recap-standfirst mb-0">{{ recap2026.standfirst }}</p>
    </div>
</header>

{# ============ 2. Proof block ============ #}
<section id="numbers" class="recap-section anchor" style="background:#fff;">
    <div class="container">
        {% if recap2026.numbers.label %}<h2 class="recap-band-title">{{ recap2026.numbers.label }}</h2>{% endif %}

        <div class="stat-band">
            {% for s in recap2026.numbers.stats %}
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="value">{{ s.value }}</div>
                <div class="label">{{ s.label }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="stat-caption">{{ recap2026.numbers.caption }}</p>

        <h3 class="recap-section-label mt-5">{{ recap2026.numbers.composition.heading }}</h3>
        <p class="composition-summary mb-4">{{ recap2026.numbers.composition.summary }}</p>
        <div class="track-cards">
            {% for t in recap2026.numbers.composition.tracks %}
            <div class="track-card">
                <div class="track-count">{{ t.count }}</div>
                <div class="track-name">{{ t.name }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        {% if recap2026.showTestimonials and recap2026.testimonials.length %}
        <div class="testimonial-grid mt-5">
            {% for t in recap2026.testimonials %}
            <figure class="testimonial">
                <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">{{ t.quote }}</blockquote>
                <figcaption class="testimonial-attrib">
                    {% if t.image %}<img class="testimonial-avatar" src="/assets/images/{{ t.image }}" alt="{{ t.name }}" loading="lazy" />{% endif %}
                    <div class="testimonial-byline">
                        <span class="name">{{ t.name }}</span>
                        {{ t.attribution | safe }}
                    </div>
                </figcaption>
            </figure>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <h3 class="recap-section-label mt-5">{{ recap2026.institutionsHeading }}</h3>
        <div class="recap-wall">
            {% for name in recapInstitutions2026.marquee %}
            <span class="wall-name">{{ name }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="wall-breadth">{{ recapInstitutions2026.breadthLine }}</p>

        <h3 class="recap-section-label mt-5">{{ recap2026.sponsorsHeading }}</h3>
        <div class="recap-sponsor-wall">
            {% set wallSponsors = [] %}
            {% for s in sponsors.gold %}{% set wallSponsors = (wallSponsors.push(s), wallSponsors) %}{% endfor %}
            {% for s in sponsors.silver %}{% set wallSponsors = (wallSponsors.push(s), wallSponsors) %}{% endfor %}
            {% for s in sponsors.bronze %}{% set wallSponsors = (wallSponsors.push(s), wallSponsors) %}{% endfor %}
            {% for s in sponsors.supporting %}{% set wallSponsors = (wallSponsors.push(s), wallSponsors) %}{% endfor %}
            {% for s in wallSponsors %}
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/assets/images/{{ s.logo }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" loading="lazy"{% if s.stacked %} class="logo-stacked"{% endif %} /></div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# ============ 3. What CAIS 2026 recognized ============ #}
<section id="winners" class="recap-section anchor">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="recap-band-title">What CAIS 2026 recognized</h2>
        <p style="max-width:44em;">{{ recap2026.winners.intro }}</p>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h3 class="winners-group-heading">Outstanding Papers</h3>
                <ul class="winners-list">
                    {% for w in recap2026.winners.outstanding %}
                    <li>
                        <span class="stamp stamp-outstanding">{{ w.award }}</span>
                        <div class="w-title"><a href="/program/2026/papers/{{ w.slug }}/">{{ w.title }}</a></div>
                        <div class="w-meta">{{ w.authors }} · {{ w.affiliation }} · {{ w.track }}</div>
                    </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h3 class="winners-group-heading">Best Artifact</h3>
                <ul class="winners-list">
                    {% for w in recap2026.winners.bestArtifact %}
                    <li>
                        <span class="stamp stamp-outstanding">{{ w.award }}</span>
                        <div class="w-title"><a href="/program/2026/papers/{{ w.slug }}/">{{ w.title }}</a></div>
                        <div class="w-meta">{{ w.authors }} · {{ w.affiliation }} · {{ w.track }}</div>
                    </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spotlight-awards" id="spotlight-awards">
            <h3 class="winners-group-heading spotlight-heading">
                {{ recap2026.winners.spotlightHeading }}
                <span class="spotlight-subtitle">({{ recap2026.winners.spotlightAttribution }})</span>
            </h3>

            <div class="spotlight-filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter spotlight awards by type">
                <button type="button" class="spotlight-filter-btn is-active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
                <button type="button" class="spotlight-filter-btn" data-filter="paper" aria-pressed="false">Papers</button>
                <button type="button" class="spotlight-filter-btn" data-filter="demo" aria-pressed="false">Demos</button>
            </div>

            <ul class="spotlight-list">
                {% for w in recap2026.winners.spotlightPapers %}
                <li data-type="paper">
                    <span class="spotlight-tag spotlight-tag--paper">Paper</span>
                    <div class="w-title"><a href="/program/2026/papers/{{ w.slug }}/">{{ w.title }}</a></div>
                    <div class="w-meta">{{ w.authors }} · {{ w.affiliation }}</div>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
                {% for w in recap2026.winners.spotlightDemos %}
                <li data-type="demo">
                    <span class="spotlight-tag spotlight-tag--demo">Demo</span>
                    <div class="w-title"><a href="/program/2026/demos/{{ w.slug }}/">{{ w.title }}</a></div>
                    <div class="w-meta">{{ w.authors }} · {{ w.affiliation }}</div>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
(function(){
    var root = document.getElementById('spotlight-awards');
    if(!root){ return; }
    var buttons = root.querySelectorAll('.spotlight-filter-btn');
    var items = root.querySelectorAll('.spotlight-list li');
    function applyFilter(filter){
        for(var i = 0; i < items.length; i++){
            var type = items[i].getAttribute('data-type');
            items[i].hidden = !(filter === 'all' || type === filter);
        }
        for(var j = 0; j < buttons.length; j++){
            var active = buttons[j].getAttribute('data-filter') === filter;
            buttons[j].classList.toggle('is-active', active);
            buttons[j].setAttribute('aria-pressed', active ? 'true' : 'false');
        }
    }
    for(var k = 0; k < buttons.length; k++){
        buttons[k].addEventListener('click', function(e){
            applyFilter(e.currentTarget.getAttribute('data-filter'));
        });
    }
})();
</script>

{# ============ 4. The full record: zone seam + browse by theme ============ #}
<section class="recap-fullrecord">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="recap-band-title">{{ recap2026.fullRecord.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mb-4" style="max-width:44em;">{{ recap2026.fullRecord.intro }}</p>
        <div class="movement-nav">
            {% for m in recap2026.movements %}
            <a class="movement-nav-card" href="#{{ m.id }}">
                <span class="movement-nav-label">{{ m.label }}</span>
                <span class="movement-nav-line">{{ m.navline }}</span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# ============ 4 to 6. The three movements ============ #}
{% for m in recap2026.movements %}
<section id="{{ m.id }}" class="recap-section anchor"{% if loop.index is odd %} style="background:#fff;"{% endif %}>
    <div class="container">
        <p class="movement-label">{{ m.label }}</p>
        <h2 class="h3 movement-headline">{{ m.headline }}</h2>
        <p class="movement-framing">{{ m.framing }}</p>

        <div class="row g-4">
            {% for f in m.featured %}
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <article class="featured-card">
                    <div>
                        <span class="stamp stamp-{{ f.tier }}">{{ f.stamp }}</span>
                        {% if f.stampNote %}<span class="stamp-note">({{ f.stampNote }})</span>{% endif %}
                    </div>
                    <h3><a href="/program/2026/papers/{{ f.slug }}/">{{ f.title }}</a></h3>
                    <p class="byline">{{ f.authors }} · {{ f.affiliation }}</p>
                    <p class="gloss">{{ f.gloss }}</p>
                </article>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="also-heading">More in {{ m.label }}</h3>
        <ul class="also-wall">
            {% for w in m.also %}
            <li>
                {% if w.crossRef %}
                <a href="{{ w.crossRef }}">{{ w.title }}</a>
                <span class="inst">{{ w.institutions | join(' · ') }} ({{ w.crossNote }})</span>
                {% else %}
                <a href="/program/2026/papers/{{ w.slug }}/">{{ w.title }}</a>
                <span class="inst">{{ w.institutions | join(' · ') }}</span>
                {% endif %}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

{# ============ 9. The view from the room ============ #}
{% if recap2026.voices.quotes.length %}
<section id="voices" class="recap-section anchor">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="recap-section-label">{{ recap2026.voices.heading }}</h2>
        <div class="row g-4">
            {% for q in recap2026.voices.quotes %}
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <blockquote class="voice-quote">{{ q.text }}</blockquote>
                <p class="voice-attrib">{{ q.name }} · {{ q.affiliation }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

